One of my favorite solutions for the castle, IF I haven't used
all of my scrolls of earth in Medusa, is to create a bolder fort
in front of the door, fill the moat, then blast the door, and
take on the lot one by one.  This is especially effective if
you're good at casting magic missle, since you can actually take
out more than one at a time.  Of course, I'll use the tune to
raise and lower the drawbridge before that, if I know it.

